        calcCopy: 'Sales are what customers paid for your design after discounts and refunds, excluding VAT and separately charged shipping. From that we deduct documented manufacturing, printing, packaging and payment-processing costs attributable to the units sold — each cost once, with its invoice or report. What remains is the profit, and the royalty is 12% of it. ETERNAL VOID covers sampling, marketing and general overhead; they are never deducted.',
