        faqA2: 'A small internal review team at ETERNAL VOID, and the technical providers that host the storage and send the email. Files sit in private storage and are reached through short-lived authorised links. They are not published, not indexed, not sent as email attachments, and not shared with a manufacturer unless and until you have signed an agreement that names that access.',
        faqQ3: 'Can I submit work made with someone else?',
        faqA3: 'Yes, if you have your co-authors’ permission to submit it and to license it, and you tell us who they are. The same applies to any third-party element in the work — a font, a photograph, a sample. If you cannot clear it, leave it out.',
